WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.500


2
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.625
<b>Lord Krishna here once again emphasizes</b>
<b>the eternal nature of the soul.</b>

3
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:41.208
<b>He says,</b>

4
00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.666
<b>the soul neither takes birth</b>

5
00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:45.500
<b>nor dies,</b>

6
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:51.125
<b>it doesn't come into being anew</b>
<b>when a body is created.</b>

7
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.708
<b>It is birthless,</b>

8
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:53.750
<b>infinite,</b>

9
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.791
<b>immortal,</b>

10
00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:56.750
<b>beyond time.</b>

11
00:00:57.333 --> 00:01:01.625


12
00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:07.416
<b>Krishna's constant emphasis on</b>
<b>these points has a single purpose </b>

13
00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:13.458
<b>to remove all doubts related to</b>
<b>this from Arjuna's mind.</b>

14
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:17.958
<b>And as far as doubts are concerned,</b>
<b>there's no shortage of them in Arjuna's mind.</b>

15
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:19.041
<b>There are many,</b>

16
00:01:19.041 --> 00:01:20.875
<b>with the biggest being that he's disturbed</b>

17
00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:25.375
<b>by the mere thought of raising weapons against</b>
<b>his kinsmen, fighting them, </b>

18
00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:31.208
<b>and possibly killing them in battle.</b>

19
00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:36.541
<b>This is why Krishna repeatedly explains</b>
<b>to him that the soul alone is real,</b>

20
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:38.541
<b>and it neither takes birth</b>

21
00:01:38.541 --> 00:01:39.958
<b>nor dies.</b>

22
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:44.166
<b>Understand this context and move beyond grief.</b>

23
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:44.916
<b>Here,</b>

24
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:51.250
<b>also understand that any worldly, physical</b>
<b>being goes through 6 stages in the cycle of time</b>

25
00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:52.125
<b>birth,</b>

26
00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:53.041
<b>growth,</b>

27
00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:53.958
<b>nourishment,</b>

28
00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:54.875
<b>reproduction,</b>

29
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:55.791
<b>decline,</b>

30
00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:57.750
<b>and finally death.</b>

31
00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.291
<b>The body takes birth,</b>

32
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:00.958
<b>develops,</b>

33
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:03.875
<b>you nourish that body through food,</b>

34
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:05.708
<b>offspring are produced,</b>

35
00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:11.458
<b>and then this body weakens</b>
<b>and eventually dies.</b>

36
00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:15.291
<b>But the soul is not affected by this cycle of time.</b>

37
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:16.875
<b>It has always been,</b>

38
00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:18.541
<b>will always be,</b>

39
00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:19.833
<b>continuous</b>

40
00:02:19.833 --> 00:02:20.708
<b>and</b>

41
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:22.333
<b>eternal.</b>

42
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.583


43
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:29.250
<b>Time.</b>

44
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.291
<b>Time is powerful,</b>

45
00:02:31.291 --> 00:02:32.208
<b>perhaps</b>

46
00:02:32.208 --> 00:02:35.708
<b>the most powerful in this creation.</b>

47
00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:37.750
<b>It cannot be caught,</b>

48
00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.875
<b>cannot be bent.</b>

49
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:42.500
<b>Birth will happen with time,</b>

50
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.541
<b>and then no matter how much anyone desires,</b>

51
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:47.583
<b>time will not stop,</b>

52
00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:50.625
<b>and it will lead to death as well.</b>

53
00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:51.958
<b>No one is</b>

54
00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:54.583
<b>untouched by this influence of time.</b>

55
00:02:54.583 --> 00:02:57.708
<b>No matter how powerful one may be,</b>

56
00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:02.708
<b>they must bow before time.</b>

57
00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:03.916
<b>But</b>

58
00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:06.000
<b>our soul form,</b>

59
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.416
<b>it is far above this cycle of time.</b>

60
00:03:09.416 --> 00:03:13.583
<b>Time has no effect on it.</b>

61
00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:17.458
<b>This is supreme knowledge,</b>

62
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.166
<b>and due to the attraction of worldly things,</b>

63
00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:24.250
<b>it might take time to understand this,</b>

64
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.958
<b>but just think,</b>

65
00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:31.333
<b>if we consider ourselves merely as a soul,</b>

66
00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:35.416
<b>how beautiful, how liberating this thought is,</b>

67
00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:39.833
<b>that we are not followers of time,</b>
<b>we are continuous,</b>

68
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:43.791
<b>endless.</b>

69
00:03:43.791 --> 00:03:47.000
<b>Try to understand it this way</b>

70
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:52.250
<b>with every level of life, our experience</b>
<b>and knowledge changes.</b>

71
00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.791
<b>When we were children,</b>

72
00:03:53.791 --> 00:03:55.875
<b>life experiences were few,</b>

73
00:03:55.875 --> 00:04:00.000
<b>even small things seemed very big.</b>

74
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.875
<b>Then</b>

75
00:04:00.875 --> 00:04:02.500
<b>in youth,</b>

76
00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.041
<b>experience tells us</b>

77
00:04:04.041 --> 00:04:09.250
<b>that what we were troubled by</b>
<b>in childhood was pointless,</b>

78
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:14.125
<b>we laugh at every childhood thought.</b>

79
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:14.958
<b>The</b>

80
00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:17.583
<b>same happens in old age</b>

81
00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:25.333
<b>we realize that the things we chased</b>
<b>in youth had no importance in life.</b>

82
00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:30.291
<b>We were worried for no reason.</b>

83
00:04:30.291 --> 00:04:31.833
<b>But</b>

84
00:04:31.833 --> 00:04:37.708
<b>now in old age, failing health and</b>
<b>fear of death troubles us.</b>

85
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:38.916
<b>Now just</b>

86
00:04:38.916 --> 00:04:42.375
<b>take this one level higher,</b>

87
00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:43.791
<b>and think</b>

88
00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:50.166
<b>that there is also a state where even this</b>
<b>fear of death will seem childish.</b>

89
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:52.458
<b>This is indeed the supreme truth.</b>

90
00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:54.458
<b>We are soul,</b>

91
00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:56.333
<b>we are eternal.</b>

92
00:04:57.416 --> 00:05:01.583


93
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:04.458
<b>When a birth occurs in the family,</b>

94
00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:06.916
<b>it is celebrated as a festival.</b>

95
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:07.791
<b>Because</b>

96
00:05:07.791 --> 00:05:10.958
<b>this is a joyous occasion.</b>

97
00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:12.041
<b>But</b>

98
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:13.833
<b>if we think about it,</b>

99
00:05:13.833 --> 00:05:17.875
<b>whose birth are we really celebrating?</b>

100
00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:21.250
<b>If our perspective is spiritual,</b>

101
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.458
<b>then has anyone really taken birth?</b>

102
00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:30.416
<b>The soul existed even before</b>
<b>the creation of this new body.</b>

103
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:31.583
<b>But</b>

104
00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:37.041
<b>even if we look purely from a</b>
<b>material perspective,</b>

105
00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:40.125
<b>where is the life in a body</b>

106
00:05:40.125 --> 00:05:46.208
<b>the body is merely a structure made</b>
<b>of a mixture of chemicals and substances.</b>

107
00:05:46.208 --> 00:05:50.750
<b>So isn't it always dead?</b>

108
00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.708
<b>You are worldly,</b>

109
00:05:52.708 --> 00:05:55.625
<b>not yet fully spiritual,</b>

110
00:05:55.625 --> 00:05:57.625
<b>it will take time,</b>

111
00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:02.625
<b>so in this case celebrating birth,</b>
<b>enjoying it is natural,</b>

112
00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:04.500
<b>and good too.</b>

113
00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.625
<b>But</b>

114
00:06:05.625 --> 00:06:11.458
<b>from now on, add another truth</b>
<b>and thought to this</b>

115
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:17.625
<b>that at the time of someone's birth,</b>
<b>an eternal soul has come to dwell in that body,</b>

116
00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:21.125
<b>has come to be your companion.</b>

117
00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:24.500
<b>And the soul has been present since eternity.</b>

118
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.666
<b>You too</b>

119
00:06:25.666 --> 00:06:29.666
<b>have been present since eternity,</b>
<b>are experienced.</b>

120
00:06:29.666 --> 00:06:36.750
<b>When two experienced beings meet,</b>
<b>having respect for each other is only natural.</b>

121
00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.583
<b>Think of it this way</b>

122
00:06:39.583 --> 00:06:44.958
<b>this thought will inspire you to hold equal</b>
<b>respect for everyone.</b>

123
00:06:44.958 --> 00:06:46.958
<b>Whether they are newborn</b>

124
00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:47.708
<b>or young</b>

125
00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:49.291
<b>or old,</b>

126
00:06:49.291 --> 00:06:50.333
<b>whether they are poor</b>

127
00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:51.166
<b>or wealthy,</b>

128
00:06:51.166 --> 00:06:53.125
<b>famous or not.</b>

129
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:58.791
<b>Everyone's spiritual level is the same.</b>

130
00:06:58.791 --> 00:07:02.125
<b>All are equal from a spiritual perspective.</b>

131
00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:05.000
<b>Respect everyone.</b>

132
00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:09.750


133
00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.333
<b>Life has many aspects.</b>

134
00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:13.500
<b>Personal,</b>

135
00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.541
<b>familial,</b>

136
00:07:14.541 --> 00:07:16.041
<b>and professional.</b>

137
00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:19.916
<b>Among these, the personal aspect is paramount</b>

138
00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:21.333
<b>after all,</b>

139
00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:26.666
<b>what fills a pot is what will quench others' thirst.</b>

140
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:28.000
<b>Similarly,</b>

141
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.583
<b>if you are satisfied with your personal aspect,</b>

142
00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:38.333
<b>it will automatically have a positive influence</b>
<b>on family and professional aspects</b>

143
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:41.375
<b>Now think for a moment,</b>

144
00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:44.541
<b>if we adopt a spiritual perspective,</b>

145
00:07:44.541 --> 00:07:51.250
<b>at a personal level we gain the strength to</b>
<b>face even an event as significant as death.</b>

146
00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.250
<b>And if this perspective holds such power,</b>

147
00:07:55.250 --> 00:08:02.625
<b>then life's other troubles, professional difficulties</b>
<b>become so small, don't they?</b>

148
00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:04.083
<b>Such thinking</b>

149
00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:08.916
<b>will give us the capability to not be</b>
<b>frightened by temporary troubles,</b>

150
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:13.916
<b>to do our work according to our principles.</b>

151
00:08:13.916 --> 00:08:16.166
<b>And when we do this,</b>

152
00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:20.041
<b>we will not only find satisfaction</b>
<b>in professional life,</b>

153
00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:20.875
<b>but</b>

154
00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:25.750
<b>this far-reaching outlook will surely bring us</b>
<b>professional success as well.</b>

